{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.8445297513326242,"t":"Test 3","y":0.04637223977583893,"w":0.057581570943196603,"h":0.014826498422712886,"c":1},{"x":0.086372361198075912,"c":1,"t":"MAN.","y":0.097383720931443207,"w":0.038387715021769214,"h":0.010174418548680286},{"w":0.059539801279703763,"y":0.11186139781873017,"t":"ANGELA:","x":0.0882723260278577,"h":0.01174232049695334,"c":1},{"t":"MAN.","h":0.0087209304424490375,"y":0.1613372091731553,"w":0.036468331019083658,"x":0.088291746108073874,"c":1},{"t":"ANGELA:","w":0.059500961303710936,"x":0.088291745739699223,"y":0.17732558140692389,"c":1,"h":0.010174418548680286},{"y":0.22529069754382336,"c":1,"w":0.036468331019083658,"x":0.08829174610274225,"t":"MAN:","h":0.0087209304424490375},{"x":0.090211132921299161,"t":"ANGELA:","y":0.25726744187090844,"w":0.055662186940511074,"h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1},{"t":"MAN:","y":0.33720930218399314,"x":0.088291748140056109,"w":0.036468327840169276,"c":1,"h":0.010174418548680286},{"w":0.25527832031249997,"y":0.094321766850923305,"c":1,"x":0.18426103168636038,"h":0.011782884447356534,"t":"And does that include breakfast?"},{"w":0.59512985229492188,"t":"Sure. And of course, guests can also make use of all the other facilities at the","h":0.016174323626497289,"y":0.11016863251177189,"c":1,"x":0.18419431465863587},{"x":0.18417189543260654,"w":0.60288238525390625,"c":1,"y":0.12557983505425752,"t":"hotel. So we've got a spa where you can get massages and facials and so on,","h":0.016902852584886996},{"w":0.42055933634440101,"h":0.016270052070497365,"t":"and there's a pool up on the roof for the use of guests.","x":0.18416663481544135,"y":0.14103200132210858,"c":1},{"x":0.18420428496904112,"w":0.53753382364908853,"h":0.016195155243016179,"t":"Great. Now what about transport links? The hotel's downtown, isn't it?","y":0.15839844317901619,"c":1},{"y":0.17438442787017683,"t":"Yes, it's about 12 kilometres from the airport, but there's a complimentary","x":0.18226679149079236,"w":0.56444859822591142,"h":0.017612811067503009,"c":1},{"t":"shuttle bus for guests. And it's only about ten minutes' walk from the central","h":0.017594689450429524,"c":1,"w":0.58556142171223957,"y":0.18977419896928294,"x":0.1822683545875923},{"t":"railway station.","y":0.20784883705484014,"x":0.18234164895060767,"h":0.011709522524090632,"w":0.11900192260742187,"c":1},{"y":0.22383720942576268,"t":"OK. Now, I don't know Sydney very well, can you just give me an idea of the","x":0.18234164300526043,"w":0.58925145467122397,"c":1,"h":0.014648595142063736},{"y":0.23974763386666254,"t":"location of the hotel?","w":0.166986567179362,"h":0.01170585463851781,"x":0.18042226333930172,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Well, it's downtown on Wilby Street, that's quite a small street, and it's not very","x":0.18234164153932123,"y":0.25581395361184311,"h":0.014534883469061066,"w":0.6065259297688802},{"w":0.59511601765950528,"t":"far from the sea. And of course if the conference attendees want to go out on","x":0.18228308193752932,"h":0.014678770961821686,"y":0.27045365152221645,"c":1},{"y":0.28769716086688335,"c":1,"x":0.18234165017084972,"t":"the Saturday evening there's a huge choice of places to eat. Then if they want","w":0.60460652669270831,"h":0.01324921135646695},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883469061177,"x":0.18234164915131421,"y":0.30377906988694503,"t":"to make a night of it, they can go on to one of the clubs in the area - there are a","w":0.61612284342447909},{"x":0.18234165387558132,"t":"great many to choose from","y":0.321135646763268,"w":0.2111324310302734,"h":0.013249211356466839,"c":1},{"h":0.014644009683410508,"t":"OK. So if we go ahead with this, can you give me some information about","c":1,"x":0.18426104752581704,"w":0.56813817342122397,"y":0.33564668786196783},{"c":1,"t":"how much ...","x":0.1841346808113147,"y":0.35419686895013025,"h":0.012942686592366859,"w":0.1020123227437337},{"w":0.026871401468912759,"y":0.14389534907655077,"c":1,"h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.81957773487015018,"t":"Q7"},{"w":0.026871401468912759,"x":0.81957773501410414,"h":0.013081394761142784,"c":1,"y":0.17587209315358554,"t":"Q8"},{"t":"Q9","x":0.81957773476794893,"h":0.013081394761142562,"w":0.024952015876769984,"c":1,"y":0.27180232581578179},{"x":0.81957773459242556,"w":0.036468331019083533,"t":"Q10","h":0.013081394761142784,"c":1,"y":0.30377907002040971},{"t":"SECTION 2","y":0.40552325575566062,"x":0.08829174424052183,"h":0.015988372176979682,"c":1,"w":0.15163148244222005},{"y":0.43389327221973262,"h":0.019278681541466947,"c":1,"x":0.088209926494242502,"t":"Good morning. My name's Lucy Crittenden, and I'm the Director of Operations for an","w":0.65465372721354165},{"x":0.090211131797384492,"y":0.45203488401239911,"t":"organisation that arranges volunteering in this part of the country. I'm hoping I can persuade","h":0.013081394761142784,"w":0.70633397420247401,"c":1},{"w":0.69865641276041668,"t":"one or two of you to become volunteers yourselves. Let me start by briefly explaining what","c":1,"x":0.088291755127812815,"y":0.46802325576868553,"h":0.015988372176979682},{"c":1,"y":0.48271200067910947,"t":"we mean by volunteering","x":0.089969469163376961,"w":0.19628982543945311,"h":0.017528251744219236},{"y":0.50872093052456291,"t":"Volunteers are teenagers and adults who choose to spend some time, unpaid, helping other","x":0.090211123161655665,"h":0.013081394761142673,"w":0.70825337727864579,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.088291755162083041,"t":"people in some way. Most volunteers devote two or three hours to this every week, while a","y":0.52460567806279368,"w":0.69865641276041668,"h":0.014638507855051275},{"c":1,"t":"few do much more. The people they help may have physical or behavioural difficulties, for","x":0.090211141418322802,"y":0.54069400622333375,"w":0.69289825439453134,"h":0.01308506324840264},{"c":1,"h":0.014570398661616468,"t":"example.","x":0.088131389727522227,"y":0.55612447135458853,"w":0.077201010386149085},{"t":"Volunteers can do all sorts of things, depending on their own abilities and interests. If they're","y":0.57981072525546085,"x":0.0902111399770439,"h":0.014666018801908765,"c":1,"w":0.71017272949218746},{"y":0.59589905368065643,"w":0.675623779296875,"c":1,"x":0.088291757104847574,"t":"supporting a family that's struggling, for example, they may be able to give them tips on","h":0.016088328075709812},{"t":"cooking, or recommend how to plan their budget or how to shop sensibly on their income.","h":0.015359831608432351,"c":1,"y":0.61172200896098394,"x":0.09017343479324344,"w":0.69104349772135409},{"w":0.7006683349609375,"t":"They might even do some painting or wallpapering, perhaps alongside any members of the","h":0.017173723768360571,"c":1,"x":0.09016685086312122,"y":0.62783160466907628},{"y":0.64534883733311188,"h":0.014588071419989634,"x":0.088291757086361666,"w":0.67562377929687512,"c":1,"t":"family who are able to do it. Or even do some babysitting so that parents can go out for"},{"c":1,"t":"Q11","w":0.032629559834798205,"x":0.82149712017857024,"y":0.62936046494215214,"h":0.01162790725659868},{"h":0.013081394761142673,"y":0.64389534896753908,"c":1,"x":0.81957773595995376,"t":"Q12","w":0.03646832784016929},{"t":"a while.","x":0.088016020731121886,"c":1,"y":0.6604250813407363,"h":0.015341697957613531,"w":0.066002508799235027},{"w":0.68138193766276034,"h":0.01324921135646695,"c":1,"t":"The benefit from volunteering isn't only for the people being helped. Volunteers also gain","x":0.092130528177976789,"y":0.68454258651018696},{"t":"from it: they're using their skills to cope with somebody's mental or physical ill health, and","x":0.088251036111747491,"y":0.70045808372163421,"h":0.016477214199511425,"w":0.68915349324544273,"c":1},{"y":0.71541993233212531,"w":0.7678746541341146,"x":0.088236350019989418,"c":1,"t":"volunteering may be a valuable element of their CV when they're applying for jobs: employers Q13","h":0.017491585523924269},{"t":"usually look favourably on someone who's given up time to help others. Significantly, most","c":1,"h":0.017475790029820581,"w":0.69673700968424468,"y":0.73110465133656366,"x":0.09021114873273367},{"t":"volunteers feel that what they're doing gives them a purpose in their lives. And in my opinion,","x":0.088251757854312801,"h":0.01758228626913072,"c":1,"y":0.74699207775750665,"w":0.72561381022135418},{"x":0.090211122726217119,"y":0.76453488363453981,"c":1,"w":0.52783111572265629,"t":"they're lucky in that respect, as many people don't have that feeling.","h":0.015988372176979682},{"h":0.01324921135646695,"c":1,"w":0.71785029093424479,"x":0.092130516625008069,"t":"Now I'd like to tell you what some of our volunteers have said about what they do, to give you","y":0.81388012613922889},{"y":0.82994186032258188,"c":1,"h":0.011698518265685132,"w":0.45873321533203121,"t":"an idea of the range of ways in which they can help people.","x":0.092130513162763161},{"w":0.6834322102864584,"h":0.017527941875277286,"c":1,"t":"Habib supports an elderly lady who's beginning to show signs of dementia. Once a week","y":0.85115820404743547,"x":0.090158009180897711},{"w":0.68347162882486978,"c":1,"h":0.017552418513252954,"t":"they, along with other elderly people, go to the local community centre, where a group of","x":0.090137872452245443,"y":0.8672677486877215},{"h":0.01611308810838763,"t":"people come in and sing. The songs take the listeners back to their youth, and for a little","y":0.88359621425589563,"x":0.090211125644856616,"w":0.67946258544921867,"c":1},{"x":0.090211134463338949,"t":"while they can forget the difficulties that they face now.","y":0.89968454265275788,"w":0.42610364278157553,"h":0.016088328075709812,"c":1},{"y":0.88226744211343311,"t":"Q15","w":0.036468331019083644,"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"x":0.8214971203889706},{"w":0.036468331019083644,"y":0.95203488397630265,"t":"109","h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.8675623795000551,"c":1}],"h":3170}